The getter currently pays a cross-TU call to `GetFieldNumValues`; inlining the equivalent field search (field number 7, main subfield, first match) removes that call overhead while preserving identical behavior.

```cpp
    FIT_UINT8 GetNumLeaderType(void) const
    {
        for (FIT_UINT8 i = 0; i < numFields; ++i)
        {
            if (field[i].Field() == 7)
            {
                return field[i].GetNumValues();
            }
        }
        return 0;
    }
```